// gemstone (as minerals — no prices or jewellery advice), per landform, and per key term (earthquakes, volcanoes,
// weather, climate). Numbers are rounded and were checked against USGS / WMO / the Geological Survey of Israel and a
// second source; uncertain figures say "כ־" or "לפי ההערכות". Concepts already on /learn/science or /learn/geography
// (earth-core, volcano, tectonic-plates, evaporation, aquifer, makhtesh, dead-sea…) are not repeated here.
